    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D LLM Wiki dedicated benchmark gates (LW-BM-01..LW-BM-04). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides reproducible latency and throughput measurements for the LLM Wiki module Wave D operability paths.</para>
<sect1 id="bench__llm__wiki__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md14_1s1"><sect2 id="bench__llm__wiki__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md14">
<title>Benchmark families</title><para><heading level="3">LW-BM-01 — Index query throughput (8-thread)</heading>
</para>
<para>≥ 1 000 queries/sec</para>
<para><heading level="3">LW-BM-02 — Article sync latency (per article)</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 1 ms</para>
<para><heading level="3">LW-BM-03 — Semantic search stub latency</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 2 ms</para>
<para><heading level="3">LW-BM-04 — Cache lookup latency</heading>
</para>
<para>p99 ≤ 100 µs</para>
</sect2></sect1>
